              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"sec-editorial bg-img-features\">\n    <div class=\"overlay-layer overlay-slate-cool\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow-badge text-center\" style=\"display: flex; width: max-content; margin: 0 auto 20px;\">THE 5 WALLS</div>\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title text-center\">Here's what really stops people from making money on Amazon:</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 35px;\">\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--crimson-fail);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--crimson-fail);\">1. \"I don't know what to publish.\"</h3>\n          <p>Niche research feels like blind guessing without real data.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--crimson-fail);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--crimson-fail);\">2. \"I can't write or design.\"</h3>\n          <p>Writing a book and designing a pro cover feels impossible.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--crimson-fail);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--crimson-fail);\">3. \"KDP keeps rejecting my files.\"</h3>\n          <p>Wrong trim, margins, bleed, spine width — rejection after rejection.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--crimson-fail);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--crimson-fail);\">4. \"AI tools give me junk.\"</h3>\n          <p>Broken puzzles, wrong answer keys, generic slop that gets refunded.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--crimson-fail);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--crimson-fail);\">5. \"I don't have time.\"</h3>\n          <p>Doing it right by hand takes weeks per book.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"card-panel\" style=\"background: var(--emerald-bg); border-top: 4px solid var(--emerald-pass);\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--emerald-pass);\">The Truth:</h3>\n          <p style=\"font-weight: 700;\">None of this is your fault. You were handed the wrong tools.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
                "_element_id": "section-11-the-5-walls"
